  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "From the huge tunnel connecting Yellow Earth Great World and Green Lotus Great World, two armies appear, led by Qing Hao Zi and Mu Cha Lang. Immortal killer move Spring Upon Withered Tree is used. Mu Cha Lang shouts as green leaves appear all over its entire tree body. The new leaves fly out and land on the Green Lotus Gu Immortals. Those Gu Immortals are not severely injured to begin with. Their large injuries become small, and their small injuries heal completely. Their condition improves immediately. In the same clash a different immortal killer move, Green Life Taker, is named.",
